{"ts":"2026-04-11T11:16:59.751Z","to":"guntur@example.com","subject":"📋 Laporan VED-FEFO Manual - 11/4/2026","text":"Laporan VED-FEFO Manual - Silakan lihat konten HTML","html":"\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head>\n      <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n      <style>\n        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; }\n        .header { background-color: #2c3e50; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }\n        .header p { margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; }\n        .summary { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .summary-box { background-color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; }\n        .summary-box.vital { border-left-color: #e74c3c; }\n        .summary-box.essential { border-left-color: #f39c12; }\n        .summary-box.desirable { border-left-color: #27ae60; }\n        .summary-box.status { border-left-color: #9b59b6; }\n        .summary-box h3 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555; }\n        .summary-box .number { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; }\n        .section { background-color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .section h2 { margin: 0 0 15px 0; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 18px; }\n        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n        th { background-color: #34495e; color: white; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; }\n        tr:hover { background-color: #f5f5f5; }\n        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 15px; color: #999; font-size: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin-top: 20px; }\n        .action-needed { background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .action-needed p { margin: 0; }\n      </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n          <h1>📋 Laporan VED-FEFO Periodic</h1>\n          <p>ObatQu - Sistem Manajemen Apotek | 11 April 2026 pukul 18.16</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"action-needed\">\n          <p><strong>⚠️ PERHATIAN:</strong> Laporan ini menunjukkan obat prioritas yang perlu segera diperhatikan. Silakan tindak lanjuti rekomendasi di bawah.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"summary\">\n          <div class=\"summary-box vital\">\n            <h3>Vital (V)</h3>\n            <div class=\"number\">23</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"summary-box essential\">\n            <h3>Essential (E)</h3>\n            <div class=\"number\">72</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"summary-box desirable\">\n            <h3>Desirable (D)</h3>\n            <div class=\"number\">47</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"summary-box status\">\n            <h3>Total Obat</h3>\n            <div class=\"number\">142</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n          <h2>🔴 URGENT - Harus Langsung Dijual/Dibuang</h2>\n          <p>Obat-obat berikut sudah kadaluarsa atau sangat dekat dengan tanggal kadaluarsa. Prioritaskan penjualan atau penarikan segera.</p>\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Nama Obat</th>\n                <th>VED</th>\n                <th>Stok</th>\n                <th>Kadaluarsa</th>\n                <th>Status</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding: 8px; text-align: center; color: #999;\">Tidak ada obat urgent</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n          <h2>🟠 KRITIS - Vital dengan Stok Rendah</h2>\n          <p>Obat-obat Vital (V) dengan stok yang rendah atau perlu segera dipesan ulang.</p>\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Nama Obat</th>\n                <th>VED</th>\n                <th>Stok</th>\n                <th>Kadaluarsa</th>\n                <th>Status</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding: 8px; text-align: center; color: #999;\">Tidak ada obat kritis</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n          <h2>🟡 MONITOR - Perlu Diperhatikan</h2>\n          <p>Obat-obat Essential (E) atau Desirable (D) yang perlu dipantau stoknya.</p>\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Nama Obat</th>\n                <th>VED</th>\n                <th>Stok</th>\n                <th>Kadaluarsa</th>\n                <th>Status</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">Enbatic Cream</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">6</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">2026-09-28</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">N/A</td>\n      </tr>\n    \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">antasida doen syr</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">15</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">2027-02-28</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">N/A</td>\n      </tr>\n    \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">lambucid suspensi 60 ml</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">5</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">2027-03-28</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">N/A</td>\n      </tr>\n    \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">asam mefenamat g</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">2027-04-28</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">N/A</td>\n      </tr>\n    \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">ketokonazol 200 mg</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">2027-04-28</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">N/A</td>\n      </tr>\n    \n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;\">Mycoral</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;\">E</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center;